@AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5291

### Register
POST {{AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### Me (uses the token from the Login response above)
GET {{AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Me without a token -> 401
GET {{AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Admin ping -> 403 for a plain User token
GET {{AiChatAssistant.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

###
